<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70219" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεο-γῑλός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>new-born, young,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύλαξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.86
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				17.58
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔριφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδοὺς ν.</span> one <i>of the
				first set</i> of teeth, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.199
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίου χρόνος ν.</span> life
				<i>short as childhood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Halc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. (In <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> l.c. glossed <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεογνῆς, . . νεωστὶ
				γεννηθείσης</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλακτι τρεφομένης</span>
			by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>; spelling and etym. are doubtful, perh. cf. Lith.
				<i>žindù</i> 'suckle'.)</div>
